  "notes": "DeepSeek-V2 (base) and DeepSeek-V2-Chat (RL) were released on 2024-05-06; the smaller DeepSeek-V2-Lite and DeepSeek-V2-Lite-Chat (SFT) followed on 2024-05-16 and are inline variants with their own date (DeepSeek presents them in the same release table, as a second size). DeepSeek-V2-0517 is the API snapshot behind deepseek-chat from 2024-05-17 (change log only, no separate weights), kept as an alias and milestone. The API id deepseek-chat served many later models and is not used as an alias."
